<http://data.silknow.org/object/90e435e9-f421-3139-b7cb-0acbd8a3aee6>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Straw plait hat, England, 1875-1880"@en , "Hat made from bands of straw plait arranged in alternating colours of blue and beige.\nIt has a small, straight sided medium high crown and a wide straight brim. It is trimmed with a wide band of blue satin ribbon tied around the crown and in a stitched bow to  one side. It is lined with blue silk. \nThere are traces of an original black elastic fastening."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/c1e38583-7b14-3cef-92b7-cb5c935c4b82> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Straw plait hat, England, 1875-1880"@en , "Hat made from bands of straw plait arranged in alternating colours of blue and beige.\nIt has a small, straight sided medium high crown and a wide straight brim. It is trimmed with a wide band of blue satin ribbon tied around the crown and in a stitched bow to  one side. It is lined with blue silk. \nThere are traces of an original black elastic fastening."@en ;
        dc:identifier                  "T.54-1980" ;
        <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs>
                <https://collections.vam.ac.uk/item/O224908> .

